	// This file IS this repo's instance of those two clauses. Read the amendment before
	// changing anything named below; the rest of this file is host-local and free.
	//
	// CONTRACT-BOUND (fleet-wide, machine-asserted):
	//   * exactly ONE dot-prefixed <repo>.code-workspace at the repo root, and folders[0]
