	//     (glob_tracked: *.code-workspace, {hub: MUST, consumer: MUST}).
	//   * the two sort keys in `settings` below -- explorer.sortOrder and
	//     explorer.sortOrderLexicographicOptions -- pinned by that check's
	//     _WORKSPACE_REQUIRED_SETTINGS per ADR-59 Decision 3. See the Explorer block.
	//
	// HOST-LOCAL (carries NO fleet claim, and must never be copied into a consumer):
	//   EVERY OTHER folders[] ENTRY. The provider-config roots below were measured on THIS
	//   host on the dates their comments give; asserting them of another machine would be
	//   asserting something false. The contract is over this file's ROLE and its sort
	//   settings -- never over its folder list.
